      "refersTo": "touch-step-button",
      "description": "Bottom frosted bar with 40px step buttons around the layer slider (G-code preview on phones).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-layerbar\"><p><b>Layer 60</b> of 60 · <b>12.00 mm</b></p><div class=\"ds-layerbar-row\"><button aria-label=\"Play\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 3l14 9-14 9z\"/></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Layer down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button><input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"60\" value=\"60\" aria-label=\"Layer\"><button aria-label=\"Layer up\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"m18 15-6-6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-layerbar{max-width:400px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--surface) 90%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-radius:12px;padding:6px 6px 4px;color:var(--fg)}.ds-layerbar p{margin:0;padding:0 6px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-layerbar-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}.ds-layerbar button{width:40px;height:40px;flex-shrink:0;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}.ds-layerbar button:hover{color:var(--fg)}.ds-layerbar button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}.ds-layerbar input{flex:1;min-width:0;accent-color:var(--accent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tag Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag-chip",
      "description": "Neutral pill with a 10px colour dot; the dot is the only colour.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-tag\"><span class=\"ds-tag-dot\"></span><span>Functional</span><button aria-label=\"Remove tag Functional\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9999px;background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--fg);padding:2px 4px 2px 10px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px}.ds-tag-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--tag-teal);flex-shrink:0}.ds-tag button{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}.ds-tag button:hover{background:var(--border);color:var(--fg)}.ds-tag button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bulk Selection Bar",
      "kind": "custom",
